WEBVTT

00:00:02.083 --> 00:00:04.625
<c.Caption-C2_1>Ai, Ai, Ai, I love you!

00:00:04.791 --> 00:00:07.291
<c.Caption-C3_1>Mai, Mai, Mai, my darling!

00:00:07.416 --> 00:00:09.958
<c.Caption-C4_1>Mii, Mii, Mii, help me!

00:00:10.125 --> 00:00:14.375
<c.Caption-C5_1>Popotan! Popotan! Popotan!

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.166
<c.Caption-C6_1>Moshimo genki wo nakushite

00:00:31.625 --> 00:00:33.916
<c.Caption-C7_1>Tohouni kuretatokiniwa

00:00:34.416 --> 00:00:38.000
<c.Caption-C8_1>Popotan no koe wo kikuno

00:00:39.416 --> 00:00:42.083
<c.Caption-C9_1>Souyo anataga sunaoni

00:00:42.291 --> 00:00:44.500
<c.Caption-C10_1>Natte kokoro wo hirakeba

00:00:45.333 --> 00:00:48.875
<c.Caption-C11_1>Popotan wa oshiete kureru

00:00:49.291 --> 00:00:51.666
<c.Caption-C12_1>Anohito wa kuru? Konai?

00:00:51.833 --> 00:00:54.416
<c.Caption-C13_1>Watashi wo suki? Kirai?

00:00:54.541 --> 00:00:57.166
<c.Caption-C14_1>Konokoi wa uso? Honto?

00:00:58.083 --> 00:01:02.333
<c.Caption-C15_1>Donna kotomo shitteruno

00:01:03.291 --> 00:01:05.875
<c.Caption-C16_1>Moudame popopo

00:01:05.916 --> 00:01:08.750
<c.Caption-C17_1>Moudame popopo

00:01:09.166 --> 00:01:13.958
<c.Caption-C18_1>Wakatterukedo yamerarenai

00:01:14.041 --> 00:01:16.416
<c.Caption-C19_1>Moumuri popopo

00:01:16.791 --> 00:01:18.833
<c.Caption-C20_1>Moumuri popopo

00:01:19.708 --> 00:01:24.541
<c.Caption-C21_1>Yume no yumedemo akeramenaide

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:26.875
<c.Caption-C22_1>Popotan!

00:01:45.791 --> 00:01:47.125
<c.Subtitle-C2_1>Wh-What?

00:01:59.333 --> 00:02:01.041
<c.Subtitle-C3_1>A-A house...

00:02:04.041 --> 00:02:05.625
<c.Subtitle-C4_1>Get back, Nono!

00:02:09.708 --> 00:02:13.708
<c.Subtitle-C5_1>Ta-daa! I am Magical Girl Mii!

00:02:15.916 --> 00:02:19.666
<c.Subtitle-C6_1>Huh? I thought it was

00:02:15.917 --> 00:02:19.666
<c.Subtitle-C6_2>a pretty catchy entrance.

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:22.833
<c.Subtitle-C7_1>No. I think you got them.

00:02:22.833 --> 00:02:27.833
<c.Caption-C23_1>Christmas

00:03:03.166 --> 00:03:05.500
<c.Subtitle-C8_1>What are you doing, Nono?

00:03:07.166 --> 00:03:08.333
<c.Subtitle-C9_1>M-Mii!

00:03:08.375 --> 00:03:11.375
<c.Subtitle-C10_1>Uh, well, nothing...

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:13.958
<c.Subtitle-C11_1>I was just doing some sweeping.

00:03:15.041 --> 00:03:16.166
<c.Subtitle-C12_1>I know!

00:03:16.166 --> 00:03:18.583
<c.Subtitle-C13_1>You're here as a customer!

00:03:19.333 --> 00:03:20.500
<c.Subtitle-C14_1>Uh, no...

00:03:21.041 --> 00:03:23.416
<c.Subtitle-C15_1>Mii, where did you go?

00:03:24.166 --> 00:03:25.958
<c.Subtitle-C16_1>We're off to find Popotan...

00:03:26.125 --> 00:03:27.750
<c.Subtitle-C17_1>Oh, Nono.

00:03:27.875 --> 00:03:30.125
<c.Subtitle-C18_1>Uh, hello.

00:03:30.583 --> 00:03:32.666
<c.Subtitle-C19_1>Ai, she's a customer!

00:03:32.666 --> 00:03:35.125
<c.Subtitle-C20_1>Nono came here as a customer!

00:03:35.416 --> 00:03:36.458
<c.Subtitle-C21_1>Really?

00:03:38.625 --> 00:03:40.583
<c.Subtitle-C22_1>Mai! Mea!

00:03:40.583 --> 00:03:42.625
<c.Subtitle-C23_1>We have a customer!

00:03:42.625 --> 00:03:45.000
<c.Subtitle-C24_1>Uh, um, that's not really...

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:46.833
<c.Subtitle-C25_1>Come in. Come in.

00:03:46.833 --> 00:03:48.541
<c.Subtitle-C26_1>But that's not it!

00:03:50.041 --> 00:03:53.625
<c.Subtitle-C27_1>So, what kind of things

00:03:50.042 --> 00:03:53.625
<c.Subtitle-C27_2>are you looking for?

00:03:54.041 --> 00:03:56.583
<c.Subtitle-C28_1>Well, um, I'm actually...

00:03:56.583 --> 00:03:58.166
<c.Subtitle-C29_1>Nono! Nono!

00:03:58.916 --> 00:04:01.125
<c.Subtitle-C30_1>What do you think of this?

00:03:58.917 --> 00:04:01.125
<c.Subtitle-C30_2>Isn't he cute?

00:04:02.791 --> 00:04:03.958
<c.Subtitle-C31_1>Well? Well?

00:04:04.291 --> 00:04:06.208
<c.Subtitle-C32_1>Wow, he really is cute.

00:04:06.416 --> 00:04:07.666
<c.Subtitle-C33_1>See? I told you!

00:04:07.708 --> 00:04:09.958
<c.Subtitle-C34_1>Come on. Don't be so pushy.

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:12.875
<c.Subtitle-C35_1>Now, a girl your age...

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:15.500
<c.Subtitle-C36_1>...might find this more appealing.

00:04:16.041 --> 00:04:17.708
<c.Subtitle-C37_1>It's wonderful!

00:04:19.875 --> 00:04:21.875
<c.Subtitle-C38_1>If you're looking for decorations...

00:04:21.916 --> 00:04:23.666
<c.Subtitle-C39_1>...how about this?

00:04:24.125 --> 00:04:25.458
<c.Subtitle-C40_1>It's wonderful!

00:04:25.583 --> 00:04:27.916
<c.Subtitle-C41_1>May I also suggest a Santa costume?

00:04:27.958 --> 00:04:30.833
<c.Subtitle-C42_1>Wow! That's so cute, too!

00:04:30.833 --> 00:04:32.250
<c.Subtitle-C43_1>And how about this?

00:04:32.458 --> 00:04:33.958
<c.Subtitle-C44_1>And this, too!

00:04:36.583 --> 00:04:40.833
<c.Subtitle-C45_1>Just looking at them makes me happy!

00:04:42.500 --> 00:04:45.458
<c.Subtitle-C46_1>Nono! What are you doing here?!

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:47.166
<c.Subtitle-C47_1>Have you finished sweeping the yard?!

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:48.708
<c.Subtitle-C48_1>G-Grandpa!

00:04:48.708 --> 00:04:50.375
<c.Subtitle-C49_1>I'm sorry!

00:04:50.375 --> 00:04:51.708
<c.Subtitle-C50_1>I'll do it right away!

00:04:51.708 --> 00:04:55.166
<c.Subtitle-C51_1>Then instead of wasting your time

00:04:51.709 --> 00:04:55.166
<c.Subtitle-C51_2>how about getting on with it?!

00:04:55.208 --> 00:04:56.208
<c.Subtitle-C52_1>Yes, sir.

00:04:56.583 --> 00:04:59.541
<c.Subtitle-C53_1>Hang on! I don't think it's nice

00:04:56.584 --> 00:04:59.541
<c.Subtitle-C53_2>to be yelling like that!

00:05:01.583 --> 00:05:04.625
<c.Subtitle-C54_1>She's in training and hasn't been

00:05:01.584 --> 00:05:04.625
<c.Subtitle-C54_2>concentrating on her work.

00:05:04.625 --> 00:05:08.166
<c.Subtitle-C55_1>I'd appreciate it if you'd stay away

00:05:04.626 --> 00:05:08.166
<c.Subtitle-C55_2>from my granddaughter.

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:13.458
<c.Subtitle-C56_1>Besides, how could you put up

00:05:09.001 --> 00:05:13.458
<c.Subtitle-C56_2>a house like this next to a holy shrine?

00:05:14.166 --> 00:05:15.583
<c.Subtitle-C57_1>You will be punished!

00:05:18.833 --> 00:05:21.416
<c.Subtitle-C58_1>Wh-What was that all about?!

00:05:21.916 --> 00:05:23.041
<c.Subtitle-C59_1>Stupid old man.

00:05:23.875 --> 00:05:28.250
<c.Subtitle-C60_1>Nono lives alone with her grandpa, right?

00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:29.666
<c.Subtitle-C61_1>He seems pretty strict.

00:05:30.083 --> 00:05:32.625
<c.Subtitle-C62_1>What do you think, Unagi?

00:05:38.583 --> 00:05:39.583
<c.Subtitle-C63_1>Nono?

00:05:39.625 --> 00:05:40.500
<c.Subtitle-C64_1>Yes, sir!

00:05:40.875 --> 00:05:43.125
<c.Subtitle-C65_1>You like things like that?

00:05:43.125 --> 00:05:44.833
<c.Subtitle-C66_1>No, not at all!

00:05:44.875 --> 00:05:46.916
<c.Subtitle-C67_1>Not at all!

00:05:47.458 --> 00:05:48.625
<c.Subtitle-C68_1>I see.

00:05:49.916 --> 00:05:53.500
<c.Subtitle-C69_1>I guess you don't like

00:05:49.917 --> 00:05:53.500
<c.Subtitle-C69_2>those things, grandpa?

00:05:53.500 --> 00:05:55.000
<c.Subtitle-C70_1>Of course not!

00:06:03.916 --> 00:06:07.708
<c.Subtitle-C71_1>Today, I saw their store.

00:06:08.416 --> 00:06:11.125
<c.Subtitle-C72_1>Grandpa scolded me...

00:06:11.125 --> 00:06:14.291
<c.Subtitle-C73_1>...but I really enjoyed seeing

00:06:11.126 --> 00:06:14.291
<c.Subtitle-C73_2>all those cute things.

00:06:32.708 --> 00:06:35.083
<c.Subtitle-C74_1>It sure is pretty.

00:06:41.458 --> 00:06:43.083
<c.Subtitle-C75_1>Are you going somewhere?

00:06:43.708 --> 00:06:44.625
<c.Subtitle-C76_1>Yup.

00:06:44.625 --> 00:06:47.041
<c.Subtitle-C77_1>I have a meeting with some parishioners.

00:06:47.041 --> 00:06:48.500
<c.Subtitle-C78_1>I'll be out for a while.

00:06:48.500 --> 00:06:49.458
<c.Subtitle-C79_1>I see.

00:06:50.125 --> 00:06:52.166
<c.Subtitle-C80_1>You already know this...

00:06:52.166 --> 00:06:54.666
<c.Subtitle-C81_1>...but stay away from

00:06:52.167 --> 00:06:54.666
<c.Subtitle-C81_2>that house while I'm away!

00:06:54.666 --> 00:06:56.833
<c.Subtitle-C82_1>Yes. I understand.

00:06:57.291 --> 00:07:01.416
<c.Subtitle-C83_1>I'm in training,

00:06:57.292 --> 00:07:01.416
<c.Subtitle-C83_2>so I'll make sure I stay away.

00:07:01.875 --> 00:07:02.833
<c.Subtitle-C84_1>Good.

00:07:21.791 --> 00:07:24.000
<c.Subtitle-C85_1>What are you doing, Nono?

00:07:26.166 --> 00:07:27.500
<c.Subtitle-C86_1>N-No!

00:07:27.666 --> 00:07:31.000
<c.Subtitle-C87_1>Y-You've got the wrong person!

00:07:27.667 --> 00:07:31.000
<c.Subtitle-C87_2>Nono is not really Nono!

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:33.166
<c.Subtitle-C88_1>What're you talking about, Nono?

00:07:33.166 --> 00:07:34.875
<c.Subtitle-C89_1>Now, come right in.

00:07:34.875 --> 00:07:36.166
<c.Subtitle-C90_1>N-No! I can't!

00:07:36.166 --> 00:07:39.875
<c.Subtitle-C91_1>I can't do that while

00:07:36.167 --> 00:07:39.875
<c.Subtitle-C91_2>I'm still in training!

00:07:39.916 --> 00:07:41.041
<c.Subtitle-C92_1>Why not?

00:07:41.041 --> 00:07:44.250
<c.Subtitle-C93_1>You really like Christmas, don't you?

00:07:44.583 --> 00:07:47.083
<c.Subtitle-C94_1>H-How could you tell?

00:07:47.083 --> 00:07:49.166
<c.Subtitle-C95_1>I can tell just by looking at you.

00:07:49.166 --> 00:07:52.958
<c.Subtitle-C96_1>You just love Christmas, don't you?!

00:07:55.166 --> 00:07:56.250
<c.Subtitle-C97_1>Actually...

00:07:58.750 --> 00:08:02.333
<c.Subtitle-C98_1>This is my favorite book ever.

00:08:02.833 --> 00:08:07.000
<c.Subtitle-C99_1>There's a scene where a family

00:08:02.834 --> 00:08:07.000
<c.Subtitle-C99_2>celebrates Christmas.

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:10.041
<c.Subtitle-C100_1>There was a Grandpa and a Grandma...

00:08:10.041 --> 00:08:11.750
<c.Subtitle-C101_1>...a Dad and a Mom...

00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:14.875
<c.Subtitle-C102_1>...a boy and girl,

00:08:11.751 --> 00:08:14.875
<c.Subtitle-C102_2>and even a dog and a cat...

00:08:14.875 --> 00:08:18.916
<c.Subtitle-C103_1>...all laughing away and

00:08:14.876 --> 00:08:18.916
<c.Subtitle-C103_2>having a wonderful time.

00:08:18.958 --> 00:08:21.208
<c.Subtitle-C104_1>And I felt warm all over.

00:08:21.208 --> 00:08:26.375
<c.Subtitle-C105_1>I felt that I wanted to have

00:08:21.209 --> 00:08:26.375
<c.Subtitle-C105_2>a Christmas just like that.

00:08:26.791 --> 00:08:29.458
<c.Subtitle-C106_1>But we're Shinto people.

00:08:30.291 --> 00:08:32.958
<c.Subtitle-C107_1>We've never celebrated Christmas.

00:08:40.666 --> 00:08:45.041
<c.Subtitle-C108_1>Magical Girl Mii will

00:08:40.667 --> 00:08:45.041
<c.Subtitle-C108_2>make your wishes come true!

00:08:45.208 --> 00:08:46.208
<c.Subtitle-C109_1>What?

00:08:46.208 --> 00:08:48.166
<c.Subtitle-C110_1>Let's celebrate Christmas together!

00:08:48.333 --> 00:08:49.333
<c.Subtitle-C111_1>What?

00:08:59.958 --> 00:09:01.625
<c.Subtitle-C112_1>M-Mii!

00:09:02.125 --> 00:09:04.458
<c.Subtitle-C113_1>I asked you to please stop!

00:09:04.458 --> 00:09:06.833
<c.Subtitle-C114_1>Don't worry. I'm finished now.

00:09:07.625 --> 00:09:08.708
<c.Subtitle-C115_1>Mii...

00:09:09.125 --> 00:09:11.083
<c.Subtitle-C116_1>Wh-What's going on here?!

00:09:11.083 --> 00:09:12.666
<c.Subtitle-C117_1>G-Grandpa!

00:09:13.333 --> 00:09:15.000
<c.Subtitle-C118_1>What is this about?!

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:16.500
<c.Subtitle-C119_1>Get rid of those right away!

00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:19.500
<c.Subtitle-C120_1>How could you let this happen?!

00:09:19.541 --> 00:09:21.291
<c.Subtitle-C121_1>I-I'm sorry!

00:09:21.625 --> 00:09:23.333
<c.Subtitle-C122_1>I'm not taking them down!

00:09:23.333 --> 00:09:26.583
<c.Subtitle-C123_1>I mean, we're getting ready

00:09:23.334 --> 00:09:26.583
<c.Subtitle-C123_2>for Christmas here!

00:09:26.583 --> 00:09:28.458
<c.Subtitle-C124_1>So I'm not taking them down!

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:29.791
<c.Subtitle-C125_1>What?!

00:09:29.791 --> 00:09:31.666
<c.Subtitle-C126_1>I-It's not Mii's fault!

00:09:31.666 --> 00:09:33.541
<c.Subtitle-C127_1>I'm the one to blame here!

00:09:36.083 --> 00:09:38.125
<c.Subtitle-C128_1>You will be punished!

00:09:38.500 --> 00:09:40.916
<c.Subtitle-C129_1>You're in training here!

00:09:41.583 --> 00:09:43.083
<c.Subtitle-C130_1>You're excommunicated!

00:09:43.083 --> 00:09:45.625
<c.Subtitle-C131_1>You shall never step foot in the shrine!

00:09:45.833 --> 00:09:47.541
<c.Subtitle-C132_1>B-But, why...?

00:09:47.541 --> 00:09:50.250
<c.Subtitle-C133_1>W-What?! You're totally overreacting!

00:09:54.708 --> 00:09:57.416
<c.Subtitle-C134_1>H-Hey! Hold it!

00:09:59.250 --> 00:10:00.958
<c.Subtitle-C135_1>You stubborn old man!

00:10:09.041 --> 00:10:10.125
<c.Subtitle-C136_1>Popotan.

00:10:13.958 --> 00:10:15.125
<c.Subtitle-C137_1>Popotan.

00:10:18.666 --> 00:10:23.375
<c.Subtitle-C138_1>So, that's why Nono's going to

00:10:18.667 --> 00:10:23.375
<c.Subtitle-C138_2>be living with us starting today.

00:10:24.333 --> 00:10:25.791
<c.Subtitle-C139_1>A-Are you serious?

00:10:26.791 --> 00:10:29.250
<c.Subtitle-C140_1>I don't think it's the right thing to do, Mii.

00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:30.958
<c.Subtitle-C141_1>Don't worry.

00:10:30.958 --> 00:10:33.333
<c.Subtitle-C142_1>You can stay in my room.

00:10:33.583 --> 00:10:35.958
<c.Subtitle-C143_1>Well, I don't mean it that way...

00:10:37.083 --> 00:10:40.958
<c.Subtitle-C144_1>Anyway, Nono, I'll show you

00:10:37.084 --> 00:10:40.958
<c.Subtitle-C144_2>around the house. Let's go!

00:10:40.958 --> 00:10:41.958
<c.Subtitle-C145_1>Uh, um...

00:10:44.625 --> 00:10:46.125
<c.Subtitle-C146_1>Is she serious?

00:10:46.125 --> 00:10:48.833
<c.Subtitle-C147_1>It's not like she can stay here forever.

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:51.833
<c.Subtitle-C148_1>It's all right.

00:10:51.833 --> 00:10:53.333
<c.Subtitle-C149_1>There's no harm done.

00:10:56.041 --> 00:10:58.791
<c.Subtitle-C150_1>I think there're other problems here.

00:10:59.458 --> 00:11:00.708
<c.Subtitle-C151_1>You think?

00:11:04.750 --> 00:11:06.916
<c.Subtitle-C152_1>This is my room.

00:11:07.791 --> 00:11:11.500
<c.Subtitle-C153_1>Tonight we can sleep together in my room.

00:11:11.916 --> 00:11:13.583
<c.Subtitle-C154_1>Uh, all right...

00:11:14.958 --> 00:11:17.458
<c.Subtitle-C155_1>Your room is much bigger than mine.

00:11:19.875 --> 00:11:21.375
<c.Subtitle-C156_1>All right. Let's have some fun.

00:11:22.541 --> 00:11:24.416
<c.Subtitle-C157_1>Change into this.

00:11:24.416 --> 00:11:25.333
<c.Subtitle-C158_1>Huh?

00:11:26.458 --> 00:11:30.125
<c.Subtitle-C159_1>W-When you're in trouble...

00:11:30.125 --> 00:11:33.208
<c.Subtitle-C160_1>...M-Magical Girl Nono

00:11:30.126 --> 00:11:33.208
<c.Subtitle-C160_2>is there for the rescue!

00:11:34.208 --> 00:11:36.000
<c.Subtitle-C161_1>L-Like that?

00:11:37.208 --> 00:11:39.500
<c.Subtitle-C162_1>We can work on it a little more.

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:42.416
<c.Subtitle-C163_1>Um, why do I have to dress like this?

00:11:42.833 --> 00:11:44.250
<c.Subtitle-C164_1>Isn't it cute?

00:11:44.250 --> 00:11:46.833
<c.Subtitle-C165_1>Now, let's go to the next room!

00:11:47.083 --> 00:11:49.791
<c.Subtitle-C166_1>Uh, dressed like this?!

00:11:53.875 --> 00:11:55.791
<c.Subtitle-C167_1>This is Mea's room.

00:11:56.333 --> 00:11:58.541
<c.Subtitle-C168_1>Wow, this is incredible!

00:11:59.208 --> 00:12:02.875
<c.Subtitle-C169_1>But why are all these clothes

00:11:59.209 --> 00:12:02.875
<c.Subtitle-C169_2>exactly the same?

00:12:02.875 --> 00:12:05.666
<c.Subtitle-C170_1>That's because Mea's the maid.

00:12:06.166 --> 00:12:08.375
<c.Subtitle-C171_1>Do you want to try one on?

00:12:08.375 --> 00:12:10.375
<c.Subtitle-C172_1>What? B-But...

00:12:10.916 --> 00:12:12.416
<c.Subtitle-C173_1>Come on. Just try it.

00:12:12.583 --> 00:12:15.000
<c.Subtitle-C174_1>N-No. Please don't...

00:12:19.625 --> 00:12:22.291
<c.Subtitle-C175_1>I feel embarrassed.

00:12:23.750 --> 00:12:27.166
<c.Subtitle-C176_1>I think you're better suited

00:12:23.751 --> 00:12:27.166
<c.Subtitle-C176_2>to the Magical Girl look.

00:12:27.416 --> 00:12:30.208
<c.Subtitle-C177_1>And it's a little tight

00:12:27.417 --> 00:12:30.208
<c.Subtitle-C177_2>around the chest.

00:12:31.291 --> 00:12:33.875
<c.Subtitle-C178_1>Mea's kind of flat, too.

00:12:34.375 --> 00:12:35.666
<c.Subtitle-C179_1>Is that right?

00:12:38.208 --> 00:12:40.083
<c.Subtitle-C180_1>This is Ai's room.

00:12:40.375 --> 00:12:41.500
<c.Subtitle-C181_1>Wow!

00:12:41.541 --> 00:12:43.625
<c.Subtitle-C182_1>What a pretty room!

00:12:44.083 --> 00:12:45.250
<c.Subtitle-C183_1>Hey, hey, hey!

00:12:45.250 --> 00:12:47.000
<c.Subtitle-C184_1>Look at these!

00:12:47.750 --> 00:12:51.375
<c.Subtitle-C185_1>Ai really has puffy boobs!

00:12:51.833 --> 00:12:53.458
<c.Subtitle-C186_1>Uh, right...

00:12:53.791 --> 00:12:55.291
<c.Subtitle-C187_1>You want to try it on?

00:12:56.291 --> 00:12:58.083
<c.Subtitle-C188_1>N-No! No way!

00:12:58.083 --> 00:13:00.375
<c.Subtitle-C189_1>It's definitely too big for me!

00:13:01.833 --> 00:13:02.958
<c.Subtitle-C190_1>Really?

00:13:03.291 --> 00:13:05.208
<c.Subtitle-C191_1>Then, how about this?

00:13:05.208 --> 00:13:07.333
<c.Subtitle-C192_1>It's Mai's brassiere.

00:13:07.583 --> 00:13:10.208
<c.Subtitle-C193_1>I think this one would be too small.

00:13:10.250 --> 00:13:13.250
<c.Subtitle-C194_1>Hey! What are you doing

00:13:10.251 --> 00:13:13.250
<c.Subtitle-C194_2>in my room?!

00:13:14.583 --> 00:13:18.416
<c.Subtitle-C195_1>Actually, you shouldn't be showing Nono

00:13:14.584 --> 00:13:18.416
<c.Subtitle-C195_2>around the house in the first place.

00:13:18.583 --> 00:13:19.583
<c.Subtitle-C196_1>That's right.

00:13:19.583 --> 00:13:21.291
<c.Subtitle-C197_1>What do you mean?

00:13:21.416 --> 00:13:24.166
<c.Subtitle-C198_1>Oh, it's almost dinnertime.

00:13:24.166 --> 00:13:25.541
<c.Subtitle-C199_1>Let's go, Nono!

00:13:25.541 --> 00:13:27.000
<c.Subtitle-C200_1>Uh, all right.

00:13:30.458 --> 00:13:33.166
<c.Subtitle-C201_1>How did she end up putting on

00:13:30.459 --> 00:13:33.166
<c.Subtitle-C201_2>my brassiere?

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:36.041
<c.Subtitle-C202_1>Thank you!

00:13:36.666 --> 00:13:38.208
<c.Subtitle-C203_1>Here you go, Mai.

00:13:38.708 --> 00:13:39.916
<c.Subtitle-C204_1>Thank you, Mea.

00:13:40.125 --> 00:13:41.375
<c.Subtitle-C205_1>I want that!

00:13:41.583 --> 00:13:43.375
<c.Subtitle-C206_1>Hey, that was mine!

00:13:43.375 --> 00:13:45.958
<c.Subtitle-C207_1>What are you doing?!

00:13:43.376 --> 00:13:45.958
<c.Subtitle-C207_2>Here you go, Unagi.

00:13:48.500 --> 00:13:52.458
<c.Subtitle-C208_1>What're you talking about?!

00:13:48.501 --> 00:13:52.458
<c.Subtitle-C208_2>There's one missing now!

00:13:52.458 --> 00:13:54.541
<c.Subtitle-C209_1>I'm taking one of yours!

00:13:56.125 --> 00:14:00.333
<c.Subtitle-C210_1>I hope you're eating dinner

00:13:56.126 --> 00:14:00.333
<c.Subtitle-C210_2>properly, Grandpa.

00:14:01.041 --> 00:14:03.791
<c.Subtitle-C211_1>What's the matter, Nono?

00:14:01.042 --> 00:14:03.791
<c.Subtitle-C211_2>Don't feel like eating?

00:14:03.791 --> 00:14:06.166
<c.Subtitle-C212_1>Oh, right. Thank you.

00:14:24.666 --> 00:14:26.666
<c.Subtitle-C213_1>You mustn't do that Mii!

00:14:26.666 --> 00:14:28.875
<c.Subtitle-C214_1>You mustn't play in the bath!

00:14:28.875 --> 00:14:30.916
<c.Subtitle-C215_1>But it's so big!

00:14:31.291 --> 00:14:33.541
<c.Subtitle-C216_1>It's meant to be played in!

00:14:33.583 --> 00:14:38.041
<c.Subtitle-C217_1>Anyway, I'm giving you a puffy check!

00:14:38.041 --> 00:14:39.041
<c.Subtitle-C218_1>What?!

00:14:42.958 --> 00:14:44.708
<c.Subtitle-C219_1>Puffy...!

00:14:45.000 --> 00:14:46.625
<c.Subtitle-C220_1>Uh, Mii!

00:14:46.625 --> 00:14:47.833
<c.Subtitle-C221_1>Hey?

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:48.708
<c.Subtitle-C222_1>Y-Yeah?

00:14:48.916 --> 00:14:50.500
<c.Subtitle-C223_1>We weren't able to do it today...

00:14:50.500 --> 00:14:54.958
<c.Subtitle-C224_1>...but we'll definitely have

00:14:50.501 --> 00:14:54.958
<c.Subtitle-C224_2>a proper Christmas tomorrow.

00:14:55.333 --> 00:14:56.333
<c.Subtitle-C225_1>Huh?

00:14:56.333 --> 00:14:57.791
<c.Subtitle-C226_1>Uh, right!

00:14:58.791 --> 00:15:01.250
<c.Subtitle-C227_1>Little puffy! Little puffy!

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:02.708
<c.Subtitle-C228_1>M-Mii!

00:15:03.791 --> 00:15:05.791
<c.Subtitle-C229_1>Good night, Nono.

00:15:05.833 --> 00:15:07.416
<c.Subtitle-C230_1>Good night.

00:15:57.375 --> 00:15:59.875
<c.Subtitle-C231_1>Nono, this Christmas thing...

00:16:01.041 --> 00:16:02.416
<c.Subtitle-C232_1>I know.

00:16:02.416 --> 00:16:04.541
<c.Subtitle-C233_1>I'm in training, after all.

00:16:18.625 --> 00:16:21.208
<c.Subtitle-C234_1>Hey, you think that's high enough?

00:16:21.833 --> 00:16:22.791
<c.Subtitle-C235_1>Here goes!

00:16:22.833 --> 00:16:25.583
<c.Subtitle-C236_1>Hey, Mii! Take it easy!

00:16:22.834 --> 00:16:25.583
<c.Subtitle-C236_2>I'm caught in it!

00:16:27.375 --> 00:16:28.625
<c.Subtitle-C237_1>Nono...

00:16:29.166 --> 00:16:33.291
<c.Subtitle-C238_1>How about we decorate

00:16:29.167 --> 00:16:33.291
<c.Subtitle-C238_2>the Christmas tree?

00:16:34.250 --> 00:16:35.250
<c.Subtitle-C239_1>Okay!

00:16:55.166 --> 00:16:56.458
<c.Subtitle-C240_1>What are you doing?

00:16:56.708 --> 00:16:59.083
<c.Subtitle-C241_1>Uh, I wasn't doing anything?

00:16:59.625 --> 00:17:01.625
<c.Subtitle-C242_1>You'll be punished for this.

00:17:02.958 --> 00:17:04.708
<c.Subtitle-C243_1>Hey, listen to this.

00:17:04.708 --> 00:17:07.208
<c.Subtitle-C244_1>I just saw your grandpa, and...

00:17:08.416 --> 00:17:10.375
<c.Subtitle-C245_1>Huh? Where's Nono?

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:13.291
<c.Subtitle-C246_1>Huh? I wonder where she went?

00:17:13.916 --> 00:17:16.625
<c.Subtitle-C247_1>She was here until just a while ago.

00:17:20.666 --> 00:17:25.125
<c.Subtitle-C248_1>There's a scene where a family

00:17:20.667 --> 00:17:25.125
<c.Subtitle-C248_2>celebrates Christmas.

00:17:25.833 --> 00:17:29.666
<c.Subtitle-C249_1>They all seemed so happy

00:17:25.834 --> 00:17:29.666
<c.Subtitle-C249_2>and I felt warm all over.

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:35.041
<c.Subtitle-C250_1>I wanted to have a Christmas just like that.

00:17:43.583 --> 00:17:44.625
<c.Subtitle-C251_1>All right!

00:17:53.291 --> 00:17:56.875
<c.Subtitle-C252_1>And now, Magical Girl Mii...

00:17:56.875 --> 00:18:00.125
<c.Subtitle-C253_1>...has a Christmas present for Nono!

00:18:00.125 --> 00:18:00.875
<c.Subtitle-C254_1>What?

00:18:00.875 --> 00:18:03.041
<c.Subtitle-C255_1>A Christmas present?

00:18:03.750 --> 00:18:07.458
<c.Subtitle-C256_1>And that is, a truly happy Christmas!

00:18:12.875 --> 00:18:15.666
<c.Subtitle-C257_1>What's going on, Mii?

00:18:25.375 --> 00:18:26.583
<c.Subtitle-C258_1>Go on.

00:18:37.333 --> 00:18:38.500
<c.Subtitle-C259_1>This is...

00:18:40.166 --> 00:18:41.666
<c.Subtitle-C260_1>Here you go.

00:18:42.125 --> 00:18:44.708
<c.Subtitle-C261_1>This is for you and your grandpa.

00:18:44.750 --> 00:18:48.250
<c.Subtitle-C262_1>You have to spend Christmas

00:18:44.751 --> 00:18:48.250
<c.Subtitle-C262_2>with your family.

00:18:49.791 --> 00:18:51.000
<c.Subtitle-C263_1>Right!

00:18:51.625 --> 00:18:55.041
<c.Subtitle-C264_1>Thank you very much, everybody!

00:19:11.083 --> 00:19:13.208
<c.Subtitle-C265_1>It's already this late.

00:19:15.375 --> 00:19:17.375
<c.Subtitle-C266_1>I guess I'll make some dinner.

00:19:20.166 --> 00:19:21.041
<c.Subtitle-C267_1>Nono!

00:19:21.458 --> 00:19:24.791
<c.Subtitle-C268_1>Let's spend Christmas together, Grandpa!

00:19:25.583 --> 00:19:28.916
<c.Subtitle-C269_1>Wh-What is this?!

00:19:25.584 --> 00:19:28.916
<c.Subtitle-C269_2>I told you not to...

00:19:28.916 --> 00:19:31.916
<c.Subtitle-C270_1>Let's eat it together, Grandpa.

00:19:31.916 --> 00:19:37.125
<c.Subtitle-C271_1>Everyone was telling me that I should

00:19:31.917 --> 00:19:37.125
<c.Subtitle-C271_2>spend Christmas with family.

00:19:37.666 --> 00:19:40.375
<c.Subtitle-C272_1>Please have this.

00:19:42.833 --> 00:19:45.208
<c.Subtitle-C273_1>I can't eat all that.

00:19:45.791 --> 00:19:47.250
<c.Subtitle-C274_1>Please have this.

00:19:55.500 --> 00:19:59.750
<c.Subtitle-C275_1>One shall be punished if one

00:19:55.501 --> 00:19:59.750
<c.Subtitle-C275_2>leaves food uneaten, after all.

00:20:00.750 --> 00:20:01.916
<c.Subtitle-C276_1>That's right!

00:20:03.916 --> 00:20:05.291
<c.Subtitle-C277_1>What's that?

00:20:05.833 --> 00:20:07.708
<c.Subtitle-C278_1>It's thanks for the cake.

00:20:08.791 --> 00:20:10.583
<c.Subtitle-C279_1>Can I open it?

00:20:10.875 --> 00:20:12.583
<c.Subtitle-C280_1>Do what you want.

00:20:16.000 --> 00:20:18.333
<c.Subtitle-C281_1>What? You don't like it?

00:20:18.333 --> 00:20:20.041
<c.Subtitle-C282_1>That's not it.

00:20:20.041 --> 00:20:22.958
<c.Subtitle-C283_1>I'm really happy right now!

00:20:25.958 --> 00:20:29.083
<c.Subtitle-C284_1>Thank you very much, Grandpa!

00:20:29.375 --> 00:20:32.166
<c.Subtitle-C285_1>Now, you'd better eat up or it'll go bad!

00:20:32.208 --> 00:20:33.541
<c.Subtitle-C286_1>Now, eat!

00:20:33.708 --> 00:20:34.916
<c.Subtitle-C287_1>Okay!

00:20:38.791 --> 00:20:40.833
<c.Subtitle-C288_1>Back to training tomorrow.

00:20:40.833 --> 00:20:43.625
<c.Subtitle-C289_1>Yes, sir! I will!

00:20:48.000 --> 00:20:52.541
<c.Caption-C24_1>To Magical Girl Nono

00:20:48.001 --> 00:20:52.541
<c.Caption-C24_2>From Mii

00:20:48.166 --> 00:20:52.375
<c.Subtitle-C290_1>I really wanted to spend

00:20:48.167 --> 00:20:52.375
<c.Subtitle-C290_2>Christmas with Nono.

00:20:53.583 --> 00:20:56.875
<c.Subtitle-C291_1>Yes. But they should be together.

00:20:56.916 --> 00:20:58.208
<c.Subtitle-C292_1>I know.

00:20:58.875 --> 00:21:02.208
<c.Subtitle-C293_1>But shouldn't you have told Nono?

00:21:02.416 --> 00:21:04.208
<c.Subtitle-C294_1>We still have time.

00:21:04.208 --> 00:21:06.500
<c.Subtitle-C295_1>No, it's okay.

00:21:06.500 --> 00:21:09.250
<c.Subtitle-C296_1>I just couldn't come out with it.

00:21:09.416 --> 00:21:10.458
<c.Subtitle-C297_1>But...

00:21:11.000 --> 00:21:15.416
<c.Subtitle-C298_1>I might've wanted to celebrate

00:21:11.001 --> 00:21:15.416
<c.Subtitle-C298_2>a real Christmas with her.

00:21:24.833 --> 00:21:26.333
<c.Subtitle-C299_1>Welcome home.

00:22:11.875 --> 00:22:15.125
<c.Caption-C25_1>Tekuno panku de aishitetainoyo

00:22:15.125 --> 00:22:18.625
<c.Caption-C26_1>Denpa ni nosete daisuki suki suki

00:22:18.625 --> 00:22:22.125
<c.Caption-C27_1>Romanchikku wo anatani agetai

00:22:22.125 --> 00:22:23.750
<c.Caption-C28_1>Waratte hoshii

00:22:23.750 --> 00:22:25.541
<c.Caption-C29_1>I love, love, love you

00:22:25.541 --> 00:22:28.833
<c.Caption-C30_1>S.U.K.I. dokidoki love

00:22:28.833 --> 00:22:32.333
<c.Caption-C31_1>S.U.K.I. gimigimi kiss

00:22:32.333 --> 00:22:35.875
<c.Caption-C32_1>S.U.K.I. sukisuki love

00:22:35.875 --> 00:22:39.500
<c.Caption-C33_1>S.U.K.I. sukiari kiss

00:22:39.500 --> 00:22:41.208
<c.Caption-C34_1>Mawaru mawaru

00:22:41.208 --> 00:22:43.125
<c.Caption-C35_1>Jikuu no hariga

00:22:43.125 --> 00:22:46.583
<c.Caption-C36_1>Kimi to boku no zahyou wo sasuno

00:22:46.583 --> 00:22:49.750
<c.Caption-C37_1>Toketeikuwa ai no himitsu

00:22:49.750 --> 00:22:54.125
<c.Caption-C38_1>Dokidoki surukoto madamada shiritaiwa

00:22:56.708 --> 00:23:03.416
<c.Caption-C39_1>Every boy, every girl kiseki wo

00:22:56.709 --> 00:23:03.416
<c.Caption-C39_2>shinjitara mirakuru kurukuru

00:23:03.875 --> 00:23:10.375
<c.Caption-C40_1>Kitto mitsukaruwa beriberi

00:23:03.876 --> 00:23:10.375
<c.Caption-C40_2>surotoberi dei beriberi beriberi

00:23:10.708 --> 00:23:16.750
<c.Caption-C41_1>Itsuka sayonara ga

00:23:10.709 --> 00:23:16.750
<c.Caption-C41_2>yattekitatte daijoubunakurai

00:23:16.750 --> 00:23:21.541
<c.Caption-C42_1>Motto anatani sukisuki daisuki tsutaetai

00:23:21.541 --> 00:23:24.625
<c.Caption-C43_1>I love you! I, I love you!

00:23:26.125 --> 00:23:30.791
<c.Subtitle-C300_1>Transform! Una!

00:23:41.208 --> 00:23:45.541
<c.Subtitle-C301_1>Well, was I cute in that episode?

00:23:46.041 --> 00:24:03.208
<c.Caption-C44_1>One More Time

00:23:46.708 --> 00:23:49.541
<c.Subtitle-C302_1>Okay, the next episode

00:23:46.709 --> 00:23:49.541
<c.Subtitle-C302_2>of Popotan is "One More Time".

00:23:49.583 --> 00:23:53.083
<c.Subtitle-C303_1>Sometimes I get sentimental

00:23:49.584 --> 00:23:53.083
<c.Subtitle-C303_2>when I think of my past.

00:23:53.083 --> 00:23:55.875
<c.Subtitle-C304_1>Yes, the warm memories

00:23:53.084 --> 00:23:55.875
<c.Subtitle-C304_2>that tug at my heartstrings.

00:23:55.875 --> 00:23:57.791
<c.Subtitle-C305_1>I wonder how he's doing now?

00:23:57.791 --> 00:24:00.791
<c.Subtitle-C306_1>The mouse whose life I spared

00:23:57.792 --> 00:24:00.791
<c.Subtitle-C306_2>because I didn't eat him.

00:24:01.333 --> 00:24:03.375
<c.Subtitle-C307_1>Oops! I'm getting hungry

00:24:01.334 --> 00:24:03.375
<c.Subtitle-C307_2>just thinking about it.

00:24:07.625 --> 00:24:09.666
<c.Subtitle-C308_1>Good night, everyone!
